 ma khong canh bao gi. Bat ky ai co backfill NAV 09-09 bang cach chay lai script deu se tao so sai am tham.", "khong_sua_gi": "daily_nav_snapshot.py la pipeline NAV (be mat bao cao tien that), NGOAI ranh gioi tu sua cua Wags — Mike cung da ghi can nguoi duyet. Khong dung code.", "da_lam": "Dong 2 question per-account (da bi rollup boi question #3) bang close_bus_question.py; giu #3 mo va re-escalate kem dinh chinh + phuong an cu the.", "files_changed": []}, "kb_version": 2890, "trace_id": "Wags_20260910_012007"}
